- countdown: {"deadline": "ISO 8601 UTC date", "onExpire": "hide"}
- spacer: {"size": "md"}

Rules: 2 to 6 elements per screen. Each screen needs a way forward (buttons, a form, or a choice with autoAdvance) unless it ends the journey.
Consent fields need "consentText". Write in the brand voice. Do not use images, videos or picture choices.

